[00:24.82] Aye means yes to a sailor
[00:27.76] Eye in a needle I can thread
[00:32.50] I is a capiltal letter
[00:37.28] But I have to live in my head
[00:50.68] If I say I too often
[00:54.48] Then I hear my vanity shows
[00:59.36] In I there is no silence
[01:03.34] I must think a thought no one knows
[01:16.68] To find out my identity
[01:20.72] I cannot start by being me
[01:25.84] But trust your eyes to truth or lies
[01:30.04] Can I get by by being I?
[01:43.28] I stand for isolation
[01:46.10] Eye is the heart of a storm
[01:51.08] I must react like my brothers
[01:55.44] If I choose that I will conform
[02:06.28] I get lost in the shuffle
[02:12.60] When I echo another's choice
[02:17.82] So I appear to be sleeping
[02:21.50] When you think I've lost my voice
